1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,774
Mehrauli ka 6 ton loha, sadiyon se zang kyun nahi khata?

2
00:00:03,774 --> 00:00:08,233
Aapke ghar ka lohe ka gate kuch saal mein bhura pad jaata hai.

3
00:00:08,233 --> 00:00:11,664
Barsaat mein cycle ki chain bhi zang kha jaati hai.

4
00:00:11,664 --> 00:00:13,722
Par Delhi mein ek khamba hai,

5
00:00:13,722 --> 00:00:16,810
jo khule aasmaan ke neeche sadiyon se khada hai.

6
00:00:16,810 --> 00:00:21,016
IIT Kanpur ke vaigyanikon ne iska wazan lagbhag 6 ton aanka hai.

7
00:00:21,016 --> 00:00:23,820
Yaani ek bade, poore jawaan haathi jitna loha.

8
00:00:23,820 --> 00:00:26,624
Aur yeh loha saanche mein dhaala nahi gaya.

9
00:00:26,624 --> 00:00:28,376
Ise wrought iron kehte hain,

10
00:00:28,376 --> 00:00:31,180
yaani garam karke hathode se peeta gaya loha.

11
00:00:31,180 --> 00:00:35,807
ASI ke naap ke hisaab se khambe ki kul oonchai 7.21 metre hai.

12
00:00:35,807 --> 00:00:40,079
Iska ek hissa aaj ke patthar ke farsh ke neeche daba hai.

13
00:00:40,079 --> 00:00:42,571
Sabse upar ghanti jaisa ek sir hai,

14
00:00:42,571 --> 00:00:46,486
jise bell capital kehte hain. Door se yeh ek seedha, shaant,

15
00:00:46,486 --> 00:00:47,910
kaala stambh dikhta hai.

16
00:00:47,910 --> 00:00:51,089
Toh sawaal seedhe hain. Yeh khamba kisne banwaya,

17
00:00:51,089 --> 00:00:54,267
yeh pehle kahan khada tha? Aur sabse bada,

18
00:00:54,267 --> 00:00:56,651
is par zang kyun nahi chadhi?

19
00:00:56,651 --> 00:00:59,830
Khambe par khuda shilalekh hamara pehla gawah hai.

20
00:00:59,830 --> 00:01:04,200
Aaj hum har jawab sabut ke saath, ek ek karke dekhenge.

21
00:01:04,200 --> 00:01:07,118
Chaliye pehle khambe ki apni zubaan sunte hain.

22
00:01:07,118 --> 00:01:10,401
Is par Sanskrit mein ek purana shilalekh khuda hai.

23
00:01:10,401 --> 00:01:13,684
Shilalekh yaani patthar ya dhaatu par khoda gaya sandesh.

24
00:01:13,684 --> 00:01:17,332
Yeh kavita ki shakl mein ek raja ki prashansa hai.

25
00:01:17,332 --> 00:01:20,250
Is kahani ka sabse purana sabut yahi hai.

26
00:01:20,250 --> 00:01:21,424
Shilalekh kehta hai,

27
00:01:21,424 --> 00:01:25,728
Chandra naam ke ek raja ne Vishnu mein apna mann lagaya.

28
00:01:25,728 --> 00:01:28,466
Phir Bhagwan Vishnu ka yeh ooncha dhwaj,

29
00:01:28,466 --> 00:01:32,379
Vishnupada naam ki pahadi par sthapit kiya. Dhwaj yaani jhanda,

30
00:01:32,379 --> 00:01:35,900
yahan matlab devta ke naam ka ek pavitra stambh.

31
00:01:35,900 --> 00:01:38,823
Ab us din ka drishya sochiye. Ek pahadi,

32
00:01:38,823 --> 00:01:41,382
subah ki narm dhoop, neeche jama log.

33
00:01:41,382 --> 00:01:43,209
Pujari mantra padh rahe hain,

34
00:01:43,209 --> 00:01:45,767
raja thodi door khade dekh rahe hain.

35
00:01:45,767 --> 00:01:49,421
Chamakta hua lohe ka stambh dheere dheere khada hota hai.

36
00:01:49,421 --> 00:01:52,710
Tasveer hamari kalpana hai, par baat shilalekh ki hai.

37
00:01:52,710 --> 00:01:56,214
Shilalekh raja ki jeet bhi ginata hai. Vanga desh mein,

38
00:01:56,214 --> 00:01:59,368
yaani aaj ke Bengal mein, dushman ekjut hokar aaye.

39
00:01:59,368 --> 00:02:02,522
Raja ne unhe apni chhaati se peeche dhakel diya.

40
00:02:02,522 --> 00:02:05,326
Yeh kavita ki bhasha hai, seedha itihaas nahi.

41
00:02:05,326 --> 00:02:08,480
Par isse raja ki shaan ka andaaza milta hai.

42
00:02:08,480 --> 00:02:13,800
Aage likha hai ki raja ne yuddh mein Sindhu nadi ke saat muhane paar kiye.

43
00:02:13,800 --> 00:02:16,637
Aur Vahlika naam ke logon ko jeet liya.

44
00:02:16,637 --> 00:02:19,474
Is shilalekh ka angrezi anuvaad epigraphist J. F.

45
00:02:19,474 --> 00:02:20,893
Fleet ne chhapa tha.

46
00:02:20,893 --> 00:02:23,730
Aaj bhi zyadatar vidwan wahi anuvaad padhte hain.

47
00:02:23,730 --> 00:02:27,014
Ab shilalekh se hatkar, logon ki zubaan par chalte hain.

48
00:02:27,014 --> 00:02:30,298
Delhi mein ek kahani peedhiyon se sunai jaati rahi hai.

49
00:02:30,298 --> 00:02:33,582
ASI ki purani reports mein bhi yeh kahani darj hai.

50
00:02:33,582 --> 00:02:35,881
Par dhyan rakhiye, yeh lok katha hai.

51
00:02:35,881 --> 00:02:38,180
Iske ghatne ka koi sabut nahi hai.

52
00:02:38,180 --> 00:02:41,844
Kahani mein Raja Anangpal hain. Ek Brahmin unse kehte hain,

53
00:02:41,844 --> 00:02:45,142
yeh khamba naagraj Vasuki ke sir mein gada hai.

54
00:02:45,142 --> 00:02:48,806
Vasuki yaani puranon mein naagon ke raja. Brahmin ne kaha,

55
00:02:48,806 --> 00:02:52,470
jab tak khamba khada hai, raaj aapke parivaar mein rahega.

56
00:02:52,470 --> 00:02:55,071
Raja ke mann mein shak jaag utha.

57
00:02:55,071 --> 00:02:58,043
Kya sach mein khamba itna gehra gada hai?

58
00:02:58,043 --> 00:03:00,644
Unhone khamba ukhadwa diya. Kahani kehti hai,

59
00:03:00,644 --> 00:03:03,988
khambe ka pair Vasuki ke khoon se geela nikla.

60
00:03:03,988 --> 00:03:06,960
Brahmin ki baat sach nikli, aur raja pachhtaye.

61
00:03:06,960 --> 00:03:10,840
Khamba wapas gaada gaya, par ab woh dheela reh gaya.

62
00:03:10,840 --> 00:03:14,721
Dheeli killi, yaani dheela khoonta, ise Dhili Killi kaha gaya.

63
00:03:14,721 --> 00:03:18,989
Kahani ke hisaab se isi se shahar ka naam pada, Dilli.

64
00:03:18,989 --> 00:03:20,542
Sunne mein mazedaar hai,

65
00:03:20,542 --> 00:03:24,810
par yeh naam ki ek lok vyakhya hai, pakka itihaas nahi.

66
00:03:24,810 --> 00:03:26,976
Ek aur parampara bahut mashhoor thi.

67
00:03:26,976 --> 00:03:30,226
Log khambe se peeth laga kar khade hote the.

68
00:03:30,226 --> 00:03:33,837
Phir dono haath peeche le jaakar milane ki koshish karte.

69
00:03:33,837 --> 00:03:37,086
Maana jaata tha, haath mil gaye toh kismat khulegi,

70
00:03:37,086 --> 00:03:40,697
mannat poori hogi. Is maanyata ki keemat khambe ne chukayi,

71
00:03:40,697 --> 00:03:41,780
woh aage dekhenge.

72
00:03:41,780 --> 00:03:44,539
Ab sabse bada sawaal, zang kyun nahi lagi?

73
00:03:44,539 --> 00:03:46,953
Pehle samjhiye ki zang hoti kya hai.

74
00:03:46,953 --> 00:03:50,402
Loha jab hawa ki oxygen aur nami se milta hai,

75
00:03:50,402 --> 00:03:53,506
bhuri parat banti hai. Woh parat jhadti rehti hai,

76
00:03:53,506 --> 00:03:55,921
aur andar ka loha khata jaata hai.

77
00:03:55,921 --> 00:03:57,990
Isi ko hum zang kehte hain.

78
00:03:57,990 --> 00:04:02,321
Is sawaal par saalon kaam kiya IIT Kanpur ke metallurgist R.

79
00:04:02,321 --> 00:04:04,683
Balasubramaniam ne. Metallurgist yaani dhaatu vaigyanik,

80
00:04:04,683 --> 00:04:07,046
jo dhaatuon ki banawat padhta hai.

81
00:04:07,046 --> 00:04:09,802
Unhone khambe ki sateh ke namoone liye.

82
00:04:09,802 --> 00:04:14,920
Phir microscope aur lab ki jaanch se unki ek ek parat ko padha.

83
00:04:14,920 --> 00:04:17,408
2002 mein unhone apna nateeja saamne rakha.

84
00:04:17,408 --> 00:04:20,961
Khambe ki sateh par ek bahut patli suraksha parat hai.

85
00:04:20,961 --> 00:04:22,383
Iska naam hai misawite,

86
00:04:22,383 --> 00:04:26,647
yaani lohe ka ek khaas oxide jo ghana aur chipka rehta hai.

87
00:04:26,647 --> 00:04:29,490
Yeh parat aam zang ki tarah jhadti nahi.

88
00:04:29,490 --> 00:04:33,640
Is parat mein ek aur cheez mili, iron hydrogen phosphate hydrate.

89
00:04:33,640 --> 00:04:35,903
Naam bhaari hai, matlab seedha hai.

90
00:04:35,903 --> 00:04:40,053
Yeh phosphorus aur lohe se bana ek crystal jaisa padarth hai.

91
00:04:40,053 --> 00:04:43,070
Misawite aur yeh phosphate milkar kawach banate hain.

92
00:04:43,070 --> 00:04:47,220
Yeh kawach hawa aur paani ko andar jaane se rokta hai.

93
00:04:47,220 --> 00:04:49,146
Matlab khamba zang se bacha nahi,

94
00:04:49,146 --> 00:04:51,715
balki ek khaas zang ne hi use bachaya.

95
00:04:51,715 --> 00:04:53,641
Shuru mein jo patli parat bani,

96
00:04:53,641 --> 00:04:56,852
wahi dheere dheere kawach ban gayi. Yeh koi chamatkar nahi,

97
00:04:56,852 --> 00:04:58,778
seedha vigyan hai. Aur sach kahun,

98
00:04:58,778 --> 00:05:02,310
yahi baat is khambe ko aur bhi kamaal ka banati hai.

99
00:05:02,310 --> 00:05:05,078
Ab is kawach ki jad dekhte hain.

100
00:05:05,078 --> 00:05:10,615
IIT Kanpur ki jaanch mein khambe ke lohe mein phosphorus ausatan 0.25 percent mila.

101
00:05:10,615 --> 00:05:12,197
Phosphorus ek tatva hai,

102
00:05:12,197 --> 00:05:16,152
jise aam taur par lohe mein ashuddhi maana jaata hai.

103
00:05:16,152 --> 00:05:18,920
Par yahan yahi ashuddhi hero ban gayi.

104
00:05:18,920 --> 00:05:20,065
Ab tulna kijiye.

105
00:05:20,065 --> 00:05:25,788
Aaj ke wrought iron mein phosphorus shayad hi kabhi 0.05 percent se upar jaata hai.

106
00:05:25,788 --> 00:05:29,222
Yaani is khambe mein phosphorus kai guna zyada hai.

107
00:05:29,222 --> 00:05:33,419
Yahi zyada phosphorus suraksha parat ko banne mein madad karta hai.

108
00:05:33,419 --> 00:05:36,090
Raaz ka pehla taala yahin khulta hai.

109
00:05:36,090 --> 00:05:38,303
Toh itna phosphorus aaya kahan se?

110
00:05:38,303 --> 00:05:41,622
Jawab praacheen Bharatiya karigaron ki bhatti mein chhupa hai.

111
00:05:41,622 --> 00:05:44,204
Woh bloomery bhatti mein loha banate the.

112
00:05:44,204 --> 00:05:46,048
Bloomery yaani chhoti khuli bhatti,

113
00:05:46,048 --> 00:05:49,367
jismein kachcha loha koyle ke saath tapaya jaata tha.

114
00:05:49,367 --> 00:05:51,580
Isse seedha loha mil jaata tha.

115
00:05:51,580 --> 00:05:55,089
Aaj ki factory mein bhatti mein choona milaya jaata hai,

116
00:05:55,089 --> 00:05:56,492
ise flux kehte hain.

117
00:05:56,492 --> 00:06:00,351
Flux yaani woh cheez jo ashuddhiyan kheench kar bahar le jaaye.

118
00:06:00,351 --> 00:06:03,158
Choona phosphorus ko bhi saath le jaata hai.

119
00:06:03,158 --> 00:06:05,263
Praacheen karigar choona nahi milate the.

120
00:06:05,263 --> 00:06:08,070
Isliye phosphorus lohe ke andar hi reh gaya.

121
00:06:08,070 --> 00:06:12,898
Phir garam lohe ke tukdon ko hathode se peet peet kar joda gaya.

122
00:06:12,898 --> 00:06:14,755
Ise forge welding kehte hain,

123
00:06:14,755 --> 00:06:18,469
yaani garam karke peet kar dhaatu jodna. Sochiye kitne karigar,

124
00:06:18,469 --> 00:06:20,697
kitni bhattiyan, kitne din lage honge.

125
00:06:20,697 --> 00:06:24,040
Un karigaron ke naam shilalekh mein kahin nahi hain.

126
00:06:24,040 --> 00:06:28,620
Ab us hisse par chalte hain jahan vidwan ek mat nahi hain.

127
00:06:28,620 --> 00:06:32,054
Pehla sawaal, shilalekh ka Raja Chandra aakhir kaun tha?

128
00:06:32,054 --> 00:06:34,344
Shilalekh mein sirf naam hai, Chandra.

129
00:06:34,344 --> 00:06:37,779
Na vansh ka naam saaf hai, na koi saal.

130
00:06:37,779 --> 00:06:40,450
Isliye yeh paheli aaj tak khuli hai.

131
00:06:40,450 --> 00:06:44,276
Ek paksh kehta hai, yeh Gupta samrat Chandragupta Dwitiya the.

132
00:06:44,276 --> 00:06:47,719
Dwitiya yaani doosre, is naam ke doosre Gupta raja.

133
00:06:47,719 --> 00:06:51,162
Gupta vansh praacheen Bharat ka ek bada rajvansh tha.

134
00:06:51,162 --> 00:06:54,222
Chandra naam ka mel Chandragupta se baithta hai,

135
00:06:54,222 --> 00:06:56,900
yahi is paksh ka seedha tark hai.

136
00:06:56,900 --> 00:06:58,315
Doosra paksh kehta hai,

137
00:06:58,315 --> 00:07:01,852
yeh Rajasthan ke Pushkarana ke Raja Chandravarman ho sakte hain.

138
00:07:01,852 --> 00:07:07,158
ASI se jude adhyayanon mein Chandra ki pehchaan par yeh sawaal gambhirta se uthaya gaya.

139
00:07:07,158 --> 00:07:08,927
Dono taraf apne tark hain.

140
00:07:08,927 --> 00:07:12,110
Aur abhi tak koi aakhri faisla nahi hua hai.

141
00:07:12,110 --> 00:07:15,790
Toh hamare haath mein kya hai? Naam pakka hai, Chandra.

142
00:07:15,790 --> 00:07:17,999
Bhakti bhi pakki hai, Vishnu ki.

143
00:07:17,999 --> 00:07:20,943
Par raja ka chehra ab bhi dhundhla hai.

144
00:07:20,943 --> 00:07:23,151
Itihaas mein aisa aksar hota hai,

145
00:07:23,151 --> 00:07:25,728
jab ek shilalekh hi akela gawah ho.

146
00:07:25,728 --> 00:07:29,040
Aur gawah sirf utna bolta hai jitna likha hai.

147
00:07:29,040 --> 00:07:33,122
Doosri paheli, khamba pehle kahan tha? Shilalekh kehta hai,

148
00:07:33,122 --> 00:07:37,205
Vishnupada pahadi par. Par aaj woh Delhi mein hai.

149
00:07:37,205 --> 00:07:42,194
Shilalekh padhne wale vidwan ko epigraphist kehte hain. Epigraphist J. F.

150
00:07:42,194 --> 00:07:46,730
Fleet ne 1898 mein kaha, yeh pahadi Mathura mein thi.

151
00:07:46,730 --> 00:07:48,764
Phir IIT Kanpur ke R.

152
00:07:48,764 --> 00:07:52,424
Balasubramaniam aur shodhkarta Meera Dass ne alag raay di.

153
00:07:52,424 --> 00:07:56,899
Unke hisaab se Vishnupada aaj ka Udayagiri hai, Vidisha ke paas.

154
00:07:56,899 --> 00:08:00,559
Unhone puratatv aur aasmaan, dono ke sabut saath rakhe.

155
00:08:00,559 --> 00:08:04,220
Puratatv yaani zameen se mili purani cheezon ka adhyayan.

156
00:08:04,220 --> 00:08:06,190
Unka tark suraj se juda hai.

157
00:08:06,190 --> 00:08:08,818
Summer solstice yaani saal ka sabse lamba din.

158
00:08:08,818 --> 00:08:12,759
Us din suraj ki seedh ko unhone pahadi ki jagah se joda.

159
00:08:12,759 --> 00:08:15,714
Meera Dass ka yeh kaam 2004 mein saamne aaya.

160
00:08:15,714 --> 00:08:18,670
Mathura ya Udayagiri, yeh bahas aaj bhi jaari hai.

161
00:08:18,670 --> 00:08:21,872
Teesra sabut bhi khambe par hi khuda hai.

162
00:08:21,872 --> 00:08:26,274
Ek chhota sa lekh, Samvat 1109 ka. Samvat yaani Vikram Samvat,

163
00:08:26,274 --> 00:08:28,275
Bharat ka ek purana calendar.

164
00:08:28,275 --> 00:08:33,478
Aaj ke angrezi calendar mein yeh 1052 isvi ke aas paas baithta hai.

165
00:08:33,478 --> 00:08:36,680
Isvi yaani CE, jo hum roz likhte hain.

166
00:08:36,680 --> 00:08:41,050
Puratatvavid Alexander Cunningham ne is lekh ko padha. Puratatvavid yaani archaeologist,

167
00:08:41,050 --> 00:08:43,832
jo khudai aur purane sabut padhta hai.

168
00:08:43,832 --> 00:08:48,600
Unke hisaab se likha hai ki Tomar Raja Anangpal ne Dilli basayi.

169
00:08:48,600 --> 00:08:52,970
Yaani yeh lekh ek shahar ke basne ki baat karta hai.

170
00:08:52,970 --> 00:08:54,947
Baad mein puratatvavid B. R.

171
00:08:54,947 --> 00:08:57,716
Mani ne isi lekh ko alag padha.

172
00:08:57,716 --> 00:09:00,880
Unke hisaab se Anangpal ne khamba kas diya,

173
00:09:00,880 --> 00:09:05,230
yaani dobara mazbooti se gaada. Ek padhaai mein shahar basta hai,

174
00:09:05,230 --> 00:09:08,394
doosri mein khamba thehrta hai. Aur yaad kijiye,

175
00:09:08,394 --> 00:09:13,140
Vasuki wali lok katha mein bhi yahi raja aur yahi khamba tha.

176
00:09:13,140 --> 00:09:16,434
Ab woh baat jo koi pakke se nahi jaanta.

177
00:09:16,434 --> 00:09:19,361
Agar khamba pehle Mathura ya Udayagiri mein tha,

178
00:09:19,361 --> 00:09:23,387
toh Delhi kaise aaya? Lagbhag 6 ton ka loha, bina truck,

179
00:09:23,387 --> 00:09:26,314
bina crane. Itni door ise kaise dhoya gaya,

180
00:09:26,314 --> 00:09:28,510
iska koi likhit hisaab nahi milta.

181
00:09:28,510 --> 00:09:30,357
Kya haathiyon se khinchwaya gaya?

182
00:09:30,357 --> 00:09:33,313
Kya nadi ke raaste naav par laaya gaya?

183
00:09:33,313 --> 00:09:35,900
Kya lakdi ke belan par sarakaaya gaya?

184
00:09:35,900 --> 00:09:38,486
Yeh sab sirf andaaze hain, sabut nahi.

185
00:09:38,486 --> 00:09:42,920
Shayad kisi din kisi purane dastavez ya khudai se iska jawab mile.

186
00:09:42,920 --> 00:09:46,683
Ek sawaal aur bhi hai, jo seedha zameen se juda hai.

187
00:09:46,683 --> 00:09:50,103
Khambe ka 1.12 metre hissa aaj farsh ke neeche hai.

188
00:09:50,103 --> 00:09:53,181
Neeche kya hai, woh aam aankh se nahi dikhta.

189
00:09:53,181 --> 00:09:55,918
Itna bhaari khamba seedha kaise khada kiya gaya,

190
00:09:55,918 --> 00:09:57,970
yeh aaj bhi hairaan karta hai.

191
00:09:57,970 --> 00:09:59,119
Ab baat aapki.

192
00:09:59,119 --> 00:10:03,716
Aaj aap Mehrauli jaakar yeh khamba apni aankhon se dekh sakte hain.

193
00:10:03,716 --> 00:10:06,781
Par ab aap use gale nahi laga sakte.

194
00:10:06,781 --> 00:10:11,761
1997 mein ASI ne khambe ke chaaron taraf lohe ki baad laga di.

195
00:10:11,761 --> 00:10:14,060
Baad yaani fence, ek suraksha ghera.

196
00:10:14,060 --> 00:10:15,837
Wajah wahi purani parampara thi.

197
00:10:15,837 --> 00:10:20,811
Anginat haathon ki ragad aur paseene se neeche ki misawite parat ghis rahi thi.

198
00:10:20,811 --> 00:10:22,943
Jo kawach sadiyon mein bana tha,

199
00:10:22,943 --> 00:10:25,785
woh logon ke pyaar se ghis raha tha.

200
00:10:25,785 --> 00:10:28,983
Isliye ASI ne beech mein thodi doori bana di.

201
00:10:28,983 --> 00:10:31,470
Mannat ab door se maangi jaati hai.

202
00:10:31,470 --> 00:10:32,482
Jab aap jaayein,

203
00:10:32,482 --> 00:10:35,856
toh khambe ke neeche ke hisse ko dhyan se dekhiye.

204
00:10:35,856 --> 00:10:39,566
Upar ka ghanti jaisa sir dekhiye, aur shilalekh ki panktiyan dhoondhiye.

205
00:10:39,566 --> 00:10:42,265
Aap ek aise sabut ke saamne khade honge,

206
00:10:42,265 --> 00:10:44,627
jo vigyan aur itihaas dono ka hai.

207
00:10:44,627 --> 00:10:48,000
Aur jo aaj bhi khule aasmaan ke neeche khada hai.

208
00:10:48,000 --> 00:10:51,892
Agli kadi mein hum chalenge Vidisha ke paas Udayagiri. Wahi pahadi,

209
00:10:51,892 --> 00:10:54,368
jise kuch vidwan asli Vishnupada maante hain.

210
00:10:54,368 --> 00:10:57,906
Dekhenge ki wahan suraj aur patthar ka kya rishta hai.

211
00:10:57,906 --> 00:11:01,090
Aur kya wahan khambe ki koi nishaani bachi hai.

212
00:11:01,090 --> 00:11:02,380
Ab aapki baari.

213
00:11:02,380 --> 00:11:06,251
Aapke hisaab se yeh khamba pehle kahan khada tha,

214
00:11:06,251 --> 00:11:10,122
Mathura ya Udayagiri? Comment mein bas ek shabd likhiye.

215
00:11:10,122 --> 00:11:14,853
Aur agar aapne kabhi ise peeth laga kar gale lagaya tha,

216
00:11:14,853 --> 00:11:17,433
toh woh kissa bhi zaroor bataiye.
